# P2 appliance v2-large — timing for cl_aleph_bp.
# clk_core is generated by the CL's MMCM from clk_hbm_ref and is auto-derived. Every crossing between it and
# clk_main_a0 goes through an XPM CDC primitive (xpm_fifo_async, xpm_cdc_gray/single/async_rst), each of
# which constrains itself. No false paths are declared here on purpose: an unconstrained crossing should
# show up in report_cdc rather than be hidden.
